        <aside class="legal-notice">
          <strong>Preview review required</strong>
          This is verbatim owner-authored copy recovered from the public 2025-02-01 archive after the original legal host stopped resolving. It contains incomplete/currently inapplicable clauses and must be reviewed before production launch.
        </aside>

        <article class="legal-copy">
          <p>
            Welcome to Promuclub.com, operated by PROMU Music Group Ltd. ("Promu," "we," "our," or "us"). By accessing or using our website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions ("Terms of Service"). Please read them carefully before using our services.
