            Promuclub.com is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. Promu makes no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, as to the operation of our site or the information, content, materials, or products included on our site. You expressly agree that your use of Promuclub.com is at your sole risk.
          </p>

          <h3>9. Limitation of Liability</h3>
          <p>
            To the fullest extent permitted by law, Promu shall not be liable for any damages of any kind arising from the use of our site or from any information, content, materials, or products included on or otherwise made available to you through our site, including, but not limited to, direct, indirect, incidental, punitive, and consequential damages.
